actual_result: Complete lock comparison retains 535 package and snapshot identities with only the ESLint version and dependent peer-resolution keys changed; other integrity metadata is identical. Strict eslint zero-warning execution and all four TypeScript projects pass. All 535 dependencies audit with zero vulnerabilities; hosted static/security checks and canonical exact-100 coverage pass. Unsupported major migrations and younger updates retain their existing owners and cooldowns.
