  "2026-10-10T04:49:09.803Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete strict 2916-item all-status census plus fresh ESLint 10.12 search and open/in-progress inventories find no owner for this version. Closed pm-940mcx owns the completed 10.9.0 refresh, not this exact eligible release. Current/wanted output alone is not a release-age verdict; the complete anonymous public time inventory establishes 10.12.0 eligibility. Adoption waits for the source-owning coverage command to finish."
  "2026-10-10T05:05:58.169Z","harness:codex","Generated pnpm update is strictly scoped: one package identity changed from ESLint 10.11.0 to 10.12.0; all other package identities and integrity metadata are unchanged. The complete lockfile retains 535 packages and 535 snapshots; only ESLint peer-resolution keys move. Updated lock SHA-256 is 33132f8ba8e8c35855595e2751ec2531e684e1a534de52bbcd8e60416c1da507. Linked strict eslint . --max-warnings=0 passes with no configuration, warning budget, suppression or rule changes. Full static/type/security and hosted verification follow."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-10T04:50:54.849Z","harness:codex","Provider eligibility: ESLint 10.12.0 was published October 2 at 20:08:19 UTC; its ^20.19.0 || ^22.13.0 || >=24 engines preserve the published >=22.18.0 floor. Installed typescript-eslint 8.71.0 declares ESLint ^8.57 || ^9 || ^10. Full current lockfile parsed before generated mutation: 270 package entries and importer peer/version metadata retained privately for comparison; no credential-bearing registry URLs. Newer TypeScript-ESLint, Knip, Marked, TOON and Unicorn candidates remain inside seven days at intake. Sentry, Vitest, TypeScript and package-parser majors retain canonical compatibility/privacy owners."
  "2026-10-10T04:52:34.731Z","harness:codex","Correction to the preceding lockfile-count sentence: the complete parsed pre-mutation file contains 535 package entries and 535 snapshot entries, with one importer, 5013 lines and 171008 bytes. The mistaken 270 count is not the machine receipt. SHA-256 11e73ee0ab05f3db6888526f976afdf28283ebadcacb4b87812b07166e17086a identifies the fully parsed input; no credential-bearing registry URLs were found."
